=== Mimicry <sec:approx_mimicry>
Borrowing ideas from nature may be one of the most self-evident approaches in replicating nature-like structures and behaviors.
More importantly, we do not need to simulate life in microscopic detail to recreate useful mechanisms, 
as will become evident in @sec:algos_sc.
For games we are usually encouraged to bend the rules, especially if 
the artistic vision is not in need of realism, as objects generally have to fit the motive of a given media to not feel out of place #todo[src?].